        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A creepy looping street where each pass has a chance to have an audiovisual anomaly. Players must decide to go forward if they haven't spotted, or go back if they have spotted an anomaly in the current pass. After 9 correct guesses in a row player wins the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825240/extras/5e0875cdd134a0da9a0d76a4cd97122c.poster.avif?t=1761398020\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825240/extras/5e0875cdd134a0da9a0d76a4cd97122c.webm?t=1761398020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825240/extras/5e0875cdd134a0da9a0d76a4cd97122c.mp4?t=1761398020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each anomaly is strange, sometimes bizarre, sometimes scary. Wrong enough to make your skin crawl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825240/extras/0456b2da3ede91f2b2ee67e21a31fce0.poster.avif?t=1761398020\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825240/extras/0456b2da3ede91f2b2ee67e21a31fce0.webm?t=1761398020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825240/extras/0456b2da3ede91f2b2ee67e21a31fce0.mp4?t=1761398020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miss one, and you're back to the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825240/extras/65c40d3070b9c48c0d49f54eb51426b0.poster.avif?t=1761398020\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825240/extras/65c40d3070b9c48c0d49f54eb51426b0.webm?t=1761398020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825240/extras/65c40d3070b9c48c0d49f54eb51426b0.mp4?t=1761398020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With randomized anomalies each run, every playthrough feels different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825240/extras/51c1ce9b1561e401ab013fe56203c615.poster.avif?t=1761398020\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825240/extras/51c1ce9b1561e401ab013fe56203c615.webm?t=1761398020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825240/extras/51c1ce9b1561e401ab013fe56203c615.mp4?t=1761398020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls:<br>W/A/S/D = move<br>Shift = run<br>Space = jump</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime (each playthrough):<br>15-60 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Final words from the developer:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was made with love. I created it because I genuinely enjoy anomaly detection walking simulators. The Exit 8 and Shinkansen 0 were major inspirations, and I wanted to build something in that spirit.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A creepy looping street where each pass has a chance to have an audiovisual anomaly. Players must decide to go forward if they haven't spotted, or go back if they have spotted an anomaly in the current pass. After 9 correct guesses in a row player wins the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825240/extras/5e0875cdd134a0da9a0d76a4cd97122c.poster.avif?t=1761398020\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825240/extras/5e0875cdd134a0da9a0d76a4cd97122c.webm?t=1761398020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825240/extras/5e0875cdd134a0da9a0d76a4cd97122c.mp4?t=1761398020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each anomaly is strange, sometimes bizarre, sometimes scary. Wrong enough to make your skin crawl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825240/extras/0456b2da3ede91f2b2ee67e21a31fce0.poster.avif?t=1761398020\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825240/extras/0456b2da3ede91f2b2ee67e21a31fce0.webm?t=1761398020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825240/extras/0456b2da3ede91f2b2ee67e21a31fce0.mp4?t=1761398020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miss one, and you're back to the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825240/extras/65c40d3070b9c48c0d49f54eb51426b0.poster.avif?t=1761398020\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825240/extras/65c40d3070b9c48c0d49f54eb51426b0.webm?t=1761398020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825240/extras/65c40d3070b9c48c0d49f54eb51426b0.mp4?t=1761398020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With randomized anomalies each run, every playthrough feels different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825240/extras/51c1ce9b1561e401ab013fe56203c615.poster.avif?t=1761398020\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825240/extras/51c1ce9b1561e401ab013fe56203c615.webm?t=1761398020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825240/extras/51c1ce9b1561e401ab013fe56203c615.mp4?t=1761398020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls:<br>W/A/S/D = move<br>Shift = run<br>Space = jump</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime (each playthrough):<br>15-60 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Final words from the developer:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was made with love. I created it because I genuinely enjoy anomaly detection walking simulators. The Exit 8 and Shinkansen 0 were major inspirations, and I wanted to build something in that spirit.</p>",
